    "text": "<p>The magnetic field in a region is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. A square loop of side d is placed with its edges along the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;axes. The loop is moved with a constant velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. The emf induced in the loop is :</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/06df4e17-d725-40fd-b508-779676e846fb-image.png\" style=\"width: 209px; height: 190px;\" /></p>",
